            "review_title": "Review at Park Lounge",
            "review_text": "Vo Tong\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nPark Hyatt, where's the passion?\nDec 2022 • Couples\nWe went to Park Lounge to enjoy breakfast and it was completely a sh**show. No SOP, employees ran around like headless chickens. You raised the bar of arrogance too high. No item confirmation after order, dishes placed to wrong person. (pictured: look at the way the waitress placed the chopsticks: one of it even fall down!!!) No smiles, employees were cold, slow and did not show any passion. \nSuch a nice place with very inviting Christmas decor but it ends there. Maybe being and staying arrogant is the way of hospitality? Look at what happened to Hyatt Hanoi.\nRead more\nWritten December 18, 2022",
